  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "姓。",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "1580",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.疑問指稱詞。[例]他去那裡了？\n2.怎。[例]他感冒這麼嚴重，那還能去看電影呢？",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "1584",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.代詞。指比較遠的人、事、物等。與「這」相對。[例]那邊有一個湖。\r\n2.表承接、轉折的語氣詞。[例]你要是沒空，那我就找別人陪我去。",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "1590",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  ],
